{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"beginEnrollmentVerification(identity:)","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:5YEOFR8YEOFRSDKC27beginEnrollmentVerification8identityAA15FRSDKReturnCodeOSS_tF","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginEnrollmentVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"identity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FRSDKReturnCodeO","text":"FRSDKReturnCode","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/yeofrsdk\/beginenrollmentverification(identity:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginEnrollmentVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"identity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FRSDKReturnCodeO","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FRSDKReturnCode","text":"FRSDKReturnCode","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The walk also PATCHES the gaps it measures: an FRR moment (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gallery fails the live user) feeds the rejected-positive capture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline — accumulate, vet (consistency 0.90), guard (anchor 0.70"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walk-1 parity, cross-identity, novelty) — and the staged centroids"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are appended to the in-memory gallery at finish, so the host’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"post-walk persist saves the patched gallery ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"centroidsAdded"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"galleryCount"},{"type":"text","text":" on the outcome; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rescuedFrames"},{"type":"text","text":" counts the frames a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch covered live). The measured FRR is always scored against the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original gallery — patches never inflate it. Cancel discards the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patches."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hosts should run this between gallery completion and persisting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tracker, surface the rate to the user, and persist regardless"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the result (recommend a re-enrol on a low unpatched rate rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than failing the save — reject loops strand users)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".trackerIsNull"},{"type":"text","text":" when the identity isn’t enrolled or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another session owns the embedding feed (also the constant return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for engines without the verification walk, e.g. Luxand)."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/beginEnrollmentVerification(identity:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 2 of the two-phase enrolment contract: arm the verification"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walk for a just-enrolled (in-memory, not yet persisted) identity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Subsequent single-face, valid-framing recognition frames are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scored against its gallery; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enrollmentVerificationStatus"},{"type":"text","text":" reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live progress and, at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finishEnrollmentVerification()"},{"type":"text","text":" (or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~60 s budget), the walk’s FRR evidence —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"recognizedFrames \/ framesVerified"},{"type":"text","text":" is the enrolment’s measured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live recognition rate, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"centroidHitCounts"},{"type":"text","text":" shows which centroids"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carried it."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/YEOFRSDK/beginEnrollmentVerification(identity:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 2 of the two-phase enrolment contract: arm the verification"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walk for a just-enrolled (in-memory, not yet persisted) identity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Subsequent single-face, valid-framing recognition frames are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scored against its gallery; "},{"code":"enrollmentVerificationStatus","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live progress and, at "},{"code":"finishEnrollmentVerification()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~60 s budget), the walk’s FRR evidence —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"recognizedFrames \/ framesVerified","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the enrolment’s measured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live recognition rate, "},{"code":"centroidHitCounts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shows which centroids","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carried it.","type":"text"}],"title":"beginEnrollmentVerification(identity:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/yeofrsdk\/beginenrollmentverification(identity:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/beginEnrollmentVerification(identity:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginEnrollmentVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"identity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FRSDKReturnCode","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FRSDKReturnCodeO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/YEOFRSDK":{"role":"symbol","title":"YEOFRSDK","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/yeofrsdk","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"YEOFR main entry point.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"YEOFRSDK","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"YEOFRSDK","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"On-device face recognition with fused liveness and TrueDepth anti-sp